WEBVTT

00:00:09.940 --> 00:00:15.750
Full energy is troubled because there's no place to go

00:00:16.210 --> 00:00:22.030
A slight shake destroys boredom

00:00:22.320 --> 00:00:28.170
I Ride, On the White Line  OH, OH, OH

00:00:28.420 --> 00:00:34.240
Sit Down  At the place I trust  OH, OH, OH

00:00:34.430 --> 00:00:37.540
We can go even if we're lost

00:00:37.770 --> 00:00:43.650
Everyone receives freedom and passion

00:00:44.040 --> 00:00:49.850
We were born to shine, and our journey continues

00:00:50.180 --> 00:00:56.060
Your soul is the key that supports our uncertain days

00:00:56.350 --> 00:01:02.000
The best growth creates an unstoppable WILD DRIVE

00:01:02.420 --> 00:01:08.270
We still quietly knock on the door

00:01:17.990 --> 00:01:23.660
ONE TURN KILL

00:01:41.820 --> 00:01:44.550
it's your turn, Marik.

00:01:44.760 --> 00:01:46.510
I draw a card.

00:01:48.450 --> 00:01:50.460
Hurry up!

00:01:50.460 --> 00:01:53.090
No matter what you do, I know what'll happen.

00:01:55.300 --> 00:02:02.750
The Winged Dragon of Ra will destroy you on my next turn.

00:02:02.750 --> 00:02:06.570
You're not the only one who can read hieratic text.

00:02:07.050 --> 00:02:11.580
The Winged Dragon of Ra will bury you in the shadows next turn!

00:02:12.970 --> 00:02:15.910
Don't be pretentious, my host's personality.

00:02:15.910 --> 00:02:20.090
Actually, I'm not sure you're the host's personality.

00:02:20.860 --> 00:02:21.590
What?

00:02:21.970 --> 00:02:29.100
The Millennium Rod, guarded by the father of the Ishtars, is now in my possession.

00:02:30.820 --> 00:02:33.570
This is mine now.

00:02:36.520 --> 00:02:38.970
The Rod accepted me.

00:02:38.970 --> 00:02:42.620
I said that I'm the crystallization of your hatred.

00:02:43.820 --> 00:02:47.010
But maybe I'm the actual personality of our host.

00:02:47.240 --> 00:02:50.250
Nonsense!  I'm the real Marik Ishtar!

00:02:52.400 --> 00:02:54.250
Whatever.

00:02:54.800 --> 00:02:58.950
If you want to summon Ra so badly, go right ahead.

00:02:58.950 --> 00:03:00.990
And learn the consequences.

00:03:01.240 --> 00:03:03.990
I activate the spell card Vengeful Bog Spirit!

00:03:06.330 --> 00:03:13.500
Whenever we summon a monster, it can't attack that turn.

00:03:13.740 --> 00:03:15.240
I end my turn.

00:03:16.770 --> 00:03:20.740
Even if you delay Ra's attack for one turn, the result is the same!

00:03:21.480 --> 00:03:22.250
I draw!

00:03:22.510 --> 00:03:25.250
Go, Bakura!  Summon Ra!

00:03:25.460 --> 00:03:27.380
Don't give me orders!

00:03:29.400 --> 00:03:31.240
Get ready, Marik.

00:03:31.250 --> 00:03:34.510
I'll let you see your precious Ra.

00:03:34.510 --> 00:03:38.620
I tribute my three ghost monsters.

00:03:39.480 --> 00:03:42.380
Come out, The Winged Dragon of Ra!

00:03:43.760 --> 00:03:45.000
I caught you.

00:03:45.000 --> 00:03:48.660
I activate the trap card Joyful Doom!

00:03:49.920 --> 00:03:50.670
What?

00:03:51.160 --> 00:03:59.200
The tributed monsters' attack points are added to my life points.

00:03:59.200 --> 00:04:03.690
And your tributed monsters' attack points drop to 0.

00:04:30.860 --> 00:04:31.860
No way!

00:04:31.860 --> 00:04:34.680
The Winged Dragon of Ra has 0 attack points?

00:04:35.350 --> 00:04:39.790
The tributed monsters' attack points determine Ra's attack points.

00:04:40.680 --> 00:04:44.800
Since the tributed monsters have 0 attack points, Ra's attack points are...

00:04:45.370 --> 00:04:46.260
Zero!

00:04:47.010 --> 00:04:50.050
What's going on?  This isn't what you promised!

00:04:50.300 --> 00:04:54.140
That card was never in my deck.

00:04:54.550 --> 00:05:00.680
Dammit!  He anticipated that we would take The Winged Dragon of Ra.

00:05:01.680 --> 00:05:06.680
He also has 8550 life points now!

00:05:06.920 --> 00:05:08.270
Damn!

00:05:08.620 --> 00:05:12.690
I switch The Winged Dragon of Ra and Puppet Master to defense position!

00:05:25.860 --> 00:05:30.710
Huh?  I'm supposed to be in Mai's room.

00:05:30.710 --> 00:05:31.710
Where am I?

00:05:38.260 --> 00:05:39.450
Who is it?

00:05:39.660 --> 00:05:41.580
Me!  Anzu!

00:05:41.800 --> 00:05:42.900
Anzu?

00:05:46.260 --> 00:05:49.310
What's wrong?  It's late.

00:05:49.310 --> 00:05:52.100
Bakura is missing!

00:05:58.460 --> 00:06:01.170
My turn.  I draw a card.

00:06:03.180 --> 00:06:04.940
Here I go, Bakura.

00:06:05.240 --> 00:06:08.340
Drillago attacks Puppet Master!

00:06:16.820 --> 00:06:18.700
Puppet Master is destroyed!

00:06:20.660 --> 00:06:21.920
I end my turn.

00:06:22.700 --> 00:06:23.930
My turn!

00:06:24.580 --> 00:06:25.930
I draw a card!

00:06:26.240 --> 00:06:29.380
You only have Ra with 0 attack points.

00:06:29.380 --> 00:06:31.660
What will you do, Bakura?

00:06:32.280 --> 00:06:36.810
What a joke.  I don't need a God with 0 attack points.

00:06:37.440 --> 00:06:40.040
I tribute The Winged Dragon of Ra!

00:06:47.540 --> 00:06:50.840
I summon Dark Ruler Ha Des!

00:06:54.180 --> 00:06:58.110
Ooh.  You're giving up on a God.

00:07:01.370 --> 00:07:07.080
Due to Exchange, you took my Monster Reborn.

00:07:07.080 --> 00:07:07.870
But...

00:07:08.740 --> 00:07:17.880
The three tributed monsters' attack and defense points determine Ra's.

00:07:18.820 --> 00:07:25.190
If you use Monster Reborn to summon Ra, it will have 0 attack points.

00:07:25.190 --> 00:07:29.630
I don't have to be scared of Ra as long as it's in the graveyard.

00:07:30.780 --> 00:07:35.360
The Winged Dragon of Ra is sealed away.

00:07:35.780 --> 00:07:39.280
But why isn't he worried?

00:07:39.280 --> 00:07:41.570
Why is he so calm?

00:07:41.920 --> 00:07:47.080
I failed to summon Ra, but my turn isn't over yet!

00:07:48.970 --> 00:07:56.090
I tribute three Fiend-Type monsters in my graveyard to summon Dark Necrofear!

00:08:03.850 --> 00:08:07.470
Next is the spell card Premature Burial!

00:08:08.120 --> 00:08:13.220
By paying 800 life points, The Earl of Demise resurrects from my graveyard!

00:08:16.970 --> 00:08:21.100
The more monsters in my graveyard, the stronger my deck becomes.

00:08:21.320 --> 00:08:24.450
Stop it!  It's too dangerous to lose life points!

00:08:24.840 --> 00:08:25.760
Silence!

00:08:25.760 --> 00:08:27.950
I told you not to give me orders!

00:08:28.450 --> 00:08:33.710
Since he gained life points, I have to take a risk to get rid of them!

00:08:33.710 --> 00:08:35.140
Calm down, Bakura.

00:08:35.140 --> 00:08:38.460
I know that he's still planning something.

00:08:38.950 --> 00:08:41.220
You know nothing!

00:08:41.220 --> 00:08:46.310
It was a mistake to use your strategy to begin with!

00:08:46.310 --> 00:08:47.200
What?

00:08:47.750 --> 00:08:49.150
Stay back!

00:08:49.150 --> 00:08:51.120
An argument?

00:08:52.000 --> 00:08:55.600
I don't care as long as you continue the game.

00:08:55.600 --> 00:09:03.190
But remember: Vengeful Bog Spirit stops any monster you summon this turn from attacking.

00:09:03.800 --> 00:09:06.800
I already know that!

00:09:06.800 --> 00:09:08.020
I end my turn!

00:09:08.020 --> 00:09:09.190
Hurry up and go!

00:09:09.420 --> 00:09:12.930
Fine.  Here I go.

00:09:13.520 --> 00:09:15.920
My turn.  I draw!

00:09:19.280 --> 00:09:21.940
Where did Bakura go?

00:09:21.940 --> 00:09:25.440
He's too hurt to move.

00:09:25.950 --> 00:09:29.680
Maybe Marik took Bakura again.

00:09:37.120 --> 00:09:41.150
If I use my Virus combo, the simulation results are...

00:09:43.240 --> 00:09:46.760
Only 13% chance of winning against the Ra Deck.

00:09:52.000 --> 00:09:53.570
Why are you laughing?

00:09:54.220 --> 00:09:56.070
One turn kill.

00:09:56.280 --> 00:09:57.260
What?

00:09:57.480 --> 00:10:01.340
You're going to die in one turn, Bakura.

00:10:01.340 --> 00:10:02.080
What?

00:10:04.240 --> 00:10:10.590
I'll show you Ra's second effect!  It's an effect that even my other personality doesn't know!

00:10:12.100 --> 00:10:14.920
An effect that I don't know?

00:10:16.460 --> 00:10:18.090
One turn kill...

00:10:37.340 --> 00:10:39.280
One turn kill...

00:10:44.420 --> 00:10:52.790
By fulfilling certain conditions, Ra can destroy all enemies and drop the opponent's life points to 0 in one turn.

00:10:56.310 --> 00:10:58.800
The three God Cards.

00:10:58.800 --> 00:11:02.400
My Obelisk the Tormentor.

00:11:02.770 --> 00:11:05.450
Yugi's Slifer the Sky Dragon.

00:11:05.450 --> 00:11:07.810
And Marik's The Winged Dragon of Ra.

00:11:08.020 --> 00:11:13.310
These Gods all require three tributes to summon.

00:11:13.800 --> 00:11:17.840
And all trap cards are powerless against the Gods.

00:11:17.840 --> 00:11:21.060
Spell cards are only good for one turn.

00:11:21.360 --> 00:11:27.060
But The Winged Dragon of Ra has an effect that the other Gods don't have.

00:11:27.060 --> 00:11:31.020
It can instantly attack when it's Special Summoned.

00:11:42.200 --> 00:11:49.160
Our spells can only affect a God Card for one turn.

00:11:49.420 --> 00:11:55.690
So Monster Reborn's effect will last for only one turn, and Ra will return to the graveyard.

00:11:56.260 --> 00:12:02.480
But due to Vengeful Bog Spirit, the summoned monster can't attack that turn.

00:12:02.700 --> 00:12:07.620
But Ra is allowed to attack instantly.

00:12:09.020 --> 00:12:11.210
One turn is enough!

00:12:11.210 --> 00:12:16.210
If Ra's secret effect activates, you're instantly defeated!

00:12:20.660 --> 00:12:25.950
If Ra is in the graveyard and I have Monster Reborn in my hand...

00:12:26.160 --> 00:12:29.460
One turn kill is possible.

00:12:37.360 --> 00:12:38.680
Look, Yugi!

00:12:38.680 --> 00:12:39.720
What's that?

00:12:40.020 --> 00:12:41.800
That's not fog!

00:12:42.170 --> 00:12:45.640
A Shadow Game created an area of shadows!

00:12:45.860 --> 00:12:47.640
That means Bakura is...

00:12:55.330 --> 00:12:59.150
Bakura is playing a Shadow Game inside.

00:12:59.150 --> 00:13:01.300
Probably against Marik.

00:13:01.300 --> 00:13:03.460
Anzu, stay back.

00:13:03.460 --> 00:13:05.160
Go back to your room.

00:13:05.380 --> 00:13:06.260
No!

00:13:06.260 --> 00:13:07.240
Anzu!

00:13:07.240 --> 00:13:11.820
You always exclude me from important moments!

00:13:12.520 --> 00:13:17.700
I know about the Millennium Items!

00:13:17.960 --> 00:13:23.160
And about the other Yugi's lost memories.

00:13:24.360 --> 00:13:25.210
Anzu...

00:13:25.570 --> 00:13:28.510
I want to help you!

00:13:36.940 --> 00:13:38.860
Playtime is over.

00:13:38.860 --> 00:13:42.440
I'll send you both into a world of darkness.

00:13:42.660 --> 00:13:45.230
I activate a spell card from my hand!

00:13:46.900 --> 00:13:48.240
Monster Reborn!

00:13:51.260 --> 00:13:56.480
Of course, I Special Summon The Winged Dragon of Ra!

00:14:07.360 --> 00:14:12.130
But since he didn't Tribute Summon, it has 0 attack and defense points.

00:14:12.130 --> 00:14:15.230
And Monster Reborn lasts for only one turn.

00:14:15.230 --> 00:14:18.130
If we survive this turn, God will vanish!

00:14:19.450 --> 00:14:21.030
Are you sure?

00:14:21.030 --> 00:14:24.310
You don't comprehend Ra's true powers.

00:14:27.840 --> 00:14:30.750
What's going to happen?

00:14:30.750 --> 00:14:31.950
I don't know.

00:14:31.950 --> 00:14:35.080
I've never heard this hieratic text before.

00:14:44.420 --> 00:14:49.100
The Millennium Rod hasn't truly revealed itself to my other personality.

00:14:49.100 --> 00:14:52.970
Only I can decipher God's effects!

00:14:56.700 --> 00:14:57.800
What?

00:14:57.800 --> 00:15:00.270
Marik's body is vanishing?

00:15:00.880 --> 00:15:04.620
I'll show you Ra's effect.

00:15:04.840 --> 00:15:10.520
By chanting the card's third line of hieratic text...

00:15:10.780 --> 00:15:18.480
...I can keep 1 life point and transfer the rest to Ra this turn!

00:15:18.750 --> 00:15:24.840
You can transform your life points into Ra's attack and defense points?

00:15:25.320 --> 00:15:26.840
That's right.

00:15:26.840 --> 00:15:28.500
And it can instantly attack.

00:15:29.100 --> 00:15:31.510
It was a fun duel, Bakura.

00:15:32.670 --> 00:15:35.420
This is the last time you'll see me.

00:15:35.420 --> 00:15:40.010
When you vanish into the shadows, my body will return to normal.

00:15:40.300 --> 00:15:41.520
What?

00:15:51.140 --> 00:15:56.920
Due to Ra's effect, Ra and I become one!

00:16:01.970 --> 00:16:04.140
Become one with Ra?

00:16:04.570 --> 00:16:06.120
Ra attacks!

00:16:06.420 --> 00:16:08.980
God Blaze Cannon!

00:16:16.800 --> 00:16:19.090
All your monsters are destroyed!

00:16:24.630 --> 00:16:26.610
And you die!

00:16:29.100 --> 00:16:32.100
Vanish, my residual personality!

00:16:41.060 --> 00:16:43.530
The Pharaoh's lost memories...

00:16:43.860 --> 00:16:47.300
Even I don't know what they are.

00:16:48.130 --> 00:16:50.720
But I'll do anything to get them.

00:16:51.000 --> 00:16:53.440
No matter what those memories are.

00:16:53.720 --> 00:16:59.100
But I don't want to put my friends in danger.

00:17:05.340 --> 00:17:06.560
Yugi...

00:17:11.600 --> 00:17:14.870
I'll admit defeat this time.

00:17:16.150 --> 00:17:17.840
I've heard that before.

00:17:18.080 --> 00:17:19.780
But remember this.

00:17:19.780 --> 00:17:23.460
I will resurrect and kill you.

00:17:23.860 --> 00:17:26.880
Because I'm the darkness itself.

00:17:44.540 --> 00:17:45.940
The darkness?

00:17:47.100 --> 00:17:50.720
Then it was fun taming the darkness.

00:17:50.980 --> 00:17:52.000
Marik!

00:17:53.480 --> 00:17:55.380
Yugi, you were here?

00:17:55.600 --> 00:17:57.380
Where's Bakura?

00:17:58.680 --> 00:18:01.140
Bakura?  I don't know.

00:18:01.140 --> 00:18:05.660
I don't care where losers go after they lose a Shadow Game.

00:18:05.900 --> 00:18:07.390
Bakura lost?

00:18:07.770 --> 00:18:10.500
Yugi, you're next.

00:18:10.500 --> 00:18:12.900
Reunite with Bakura in the afterlife.

00:18:28.800 --> 00:18:30.420
Sis!

00:18:32.570 --> 00:18:33.770
Marik...

00:18:40.080 --> 00:18:41.310
You're...

00:18:41.760 --> 00:18:43.960
Sis...

00:18:44.570 --> 00:18:45.460
Rishido...

00:18:46.210 --> 00:18:47.030
Marik!

00:18:47.940 --> 00:18:50.040
Save Rishido from him!

00:18:58.980 --> 00:19:02.550
I didn't expect my Parasite Mind to be useful like this.

00:19:03.080 --> 00:19:12.120
The Millennium Ring has the power to put a part of my soul inside an object, such as this Puzzle piece!

00:19:15.460 --> 00:19:16.970
Parasite Mind!

00:19:16.970 --> 00:19:18.360
It's done.

00:19:19.080 --> 00:19:24.070
When Marik defeated me, I was able to escape here.

00:19:27.280 --> 00:19:31.580
Unfortunately, I have to postpone collecting the Millennium Items.

00:19:31.800 --> 00:19:36.080
I'll search for the true door somewhere in this maze instead.

00:19:54.110 --> 00:19:55.870
Where did he go?

00:20:02.300 --> 00:20:06.450
The invincible God Card can win in one turn.

00:20:06.800 --> 00:20:09.380
Is there a way to counter Ra?

00:20:18.600 --> 00:20:21.160
Big brother, you're still up?

00:20:21.160 --> 00:20:23.020
You should rest.

00:20:23.020 --> 00:20:24.900
Tomorrow is the finals.

00:20:25.160 --> 00:20:26.900
I know.

00:20:27.520 --> 00:20:28.860
Big brother...

00:20:38.300 --> 00:20:42.150
We're heading to the final venue - Alcatraz Island.

00:20:42.550 --> 00:20:47.620
My late father, Gozaburo Kaiba, used his wealth to build the island...

00:20:47.620 --> 00:20:51.040
...to serve as the central hub of the hi-tech military industry.

00:20:51.540 --> 00:20:58.560
After he died, my brother destroyed the military facilities and built the Duel Tower on top of it.

00:20:59.100 --> 00:21:03.180
Mokuba, I'll win the finals at Alcatraz.

00:21:03.180 --> 00:21:09.070
When I get the title of Duel King, I will become the true victor!

00:21:09.320 --> 00:21:14.560
And I'll be able to overcome the grudge rooted in my heart.

00:21:19.480 --> 00:21:24.590
If my instincts are correct, I can defeat Ra.

00:21:25.060 --> 00:21:28.590
Just wait!  The final battle is at Alcatraz!

00:21:29.110 --> 00:21:34.400
I'll become the true Duel King and win my future!

00:21:44.040 --> 00:21:45.080
Big trouble!

00:21:45.080 --> 00:21:50.000
The Battle Ship is headed to the semifinals, but it suddenly changes direction!

00:21:50.000 --> 00:21:54.170
Someone took over the controls?

00:21:54.170 --> 00:21:58.560
A giant object suddenly rises from the ocean.

00:21:58.560 --> 00:22:01.510
What is it?  And who's Noa?

00:22:01.510 --> 00:22:03.820
Nobody said this would happen!

00:22:03.820 --> 00:22:08.170
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh!:
Mysterious Challenger
Giant Moving Fortress Surfaces!

00:22:08.170 --> 00:22:09.770
Duel, standby!

00:22:13.450 --> 00:22:21.360
The sun never sets
It rises forever

00:22:21.360 --> 00:22:30.300
Don't let a dream end as a dream

00:22:30.630 --> 00:22:35.270
The straight rail and harsh route

00:22:35.270 --> 00:22:39.240
Whether to go or not 
all of yourself

00:22:39.670 --> 00:22:47.210
I'm tired of counting on my fingers inside this cage

00:22:47.210 --> 00:22:50.780
Respect! Boys  Show me how you act tough

00:22:50.780 --> 00:22:55.550
Draw a map, even if it's sloppy

00:22:55.550 --> 00:23:05.660
And walk it without stopping

00:23:05.660 --> 00:23:13.270
The sun never sets
If I can be like you

00:23:13.500 --> 00:23:22.240
Create freedom by exceeding common ideas

00:23:22.240 --> 00:23:30.220
I want to trust myself
Sometimes I'll lose my way but

00:23:30.220 --> 00:23:40.060
I hide it in my heart...
Secret Paradise
